          <string>Description</string>
          <string>P21 Opcode class decoder - Digital task
Full size: AND gates with inverted inputs for each opcode; a Comparator with a Const is allowed for ECALL/MRET.
Allowed parts: all of the above + Add, Sub, Comparator, Neg
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string>
